<title>USA: Pass Christian, Miss., okays $10.1 mln school GOs.</title>
<headline>Pass Christian, Miss., okays $10.1 mln school GOs.</headline>
<dateline>PASS CHRISTIAN, Miss. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Pass Christian, Miss., approved a $10.1 million general obligation bond issue for schools, city elections officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposal passed by a wide margin in Tuesday's referendum. It will finance construction of a new high school and improvements to schools.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
</text>
